    "tip": "Do not say the United States backed France at Algeciras. Say Germany was supported only by Austria-Hungary and that Britain and Russia backed France. Keep Tangier (Wilhelm's 1905 landing) and Algeciras (the 1906 conference) apart from Agadir (1911)."
