    "tip": "A closing paragraph on the Pius XII debate or the limits of church protest earns evaluation marks. Give both sides, and keep Pius XI (Lateran Treaties, both encyclicals) apart from Pius XII (the Reich Concordat negotiator and the wartime silence debate)."
