    "tip": "Ordinary Level questions on why Parnell fell expect the divorce, Gladstone’s letter, the bishops and the split, with dates. Explain why the Liberals and the Church each turned against him, not just that they did. Keep the Irish National League (Parnellites) apart from the Irish National Federation (anti-Parnellites)."
