    "tip": "Cause-and-result questions ask why Britain gave up the ports in 1938: give Chamberlain's wish for better relations as war approached and mention Churchill's opposition. Do not confuse these 1938 Agreements (ports, annuities, trade) with the 1935 Coal–Cattle Pact."
